<title>FRANCE: Tennis-Friday's schedule of matches at the French Open.</title>
<headline>Tennis-Friday's schedule of matches at the French Open.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-05-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Schedule of matches on show courts at the French Open tennis championships on Friday (matches start 0900 GMT):</p>
<p>Centre court</p>
<p>Lionel Roux (France) v 15-Marc Rosset (Switzerland)</p>
<p>Magui Serna (Spain) v 2-Steffi Graf (Germany)</p>
<p>3-Yevgeny Kafelnikov (Russia) v Cedric Pioline (France)</p>
<p>Nicole Arendt (U.S.) v 4-Jana Novotna (Czech Republic)</p>
<p>Court A</p>
<p>15-Karina Habsudova (Slovakia) v Ruxandra Dragomir (Romania)</p>
<p>Andrei Medvedev (Ukraine) v Nicolas Escude (France)</p>
<p>7-Conchita Martinez (Spain) v Caroline Dhenin (France)</p>
<p>1-Pete Sampras (U.S.) v Magnus Norman (Sweden)</p>
<p>Court 1</p>
<p>Meike Babel (Germany) v 11-Amanda Coetzer (South Africa)</p>
<p>Gustavo Kuerten (Brazil) v 5-Thomas Muster (Austria)</p>
<p>5-Lindsay Davenport (U.S.) v Patty Schnyder (Switzerland)</p>
<p>Thierry Champion (France) v 8-Alex Corretja (Spain).</p>
</text>
